---
/*
 * "About" grid from the Next.js home page (components/home/about). Three explicit
 * columns; the last card in each stretches so the bottoms line up. On phones the
 * columns dissolve (`contents`) and the cards reflow into the old two-column grid.
 */
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import Heading from "@/components/typography/Heading.astro"
import Text from "@/components/typography/Text.astro"
import ArrowUpRight from "@/components/icons/ArrowUpRight.astro"
import PenTool from "@/components/icons/PenTool.astro"
import BentoCard from "./BentoCard.astro"
import NowPlayingCard from "./NowPlayingCard.astro"
import ToolsDock from "./ToolsDock.astro"
import miniGole from "@/assets/images/mini-gole.jpg"
import profile from "@/assets/images/profile.png"
import hungerStrikeAlbum from "@/assets/images/hunger-strike-album.png"

const recentFavorite = {
  title: "Hunger Strike",
  artist: "Temple of the Dog",
  albumImageUrl: hungerStrikeAlbum.src,
  songUrl: "https://open.spotify.com/track/0W7AbEauB7cP4pidLclApe",
}

// Shared card typography: quiet, so the cards read as content rather than a type specimen
const eyebrow = "text-xs opacity-75"
const title = "font-medium"
const body = "text-sm opacity-80"
const cardLink = "mt-3 inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium underline-offset-[0.2em] hover:underline"
---

<section>
  <Heading>About</Heading>
  <Text class="mt-2 mb-6">
    I craft thoughtful digital experiences that feel clear, fast, and genuinely useful in everyday use.
  </Text>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-y-0">
    <div class="contents md:flex md:flex-col">
      <BentoCard tone="blue" class="order-1 min-h-32 justify-between md:order-none">
        <div class="h-1 w-12 rounded-full bg-white/50"></div>
        <span class="mt-8 self-end rounded-full bg-[#FFD166] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#352600]">About me</span>
      </BentoCard>

      <BentoCard tone="image" class="order-3 col-span-2 min-h-50 flex-1 md:order-none md:col-span-1 md:min-h-80">
        <Image
          src={miniGole}
          alt="Manish as a kid, standing in front of a stone wall"
          width={800}
          widths={[280, 420, 560, 800]}
          sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 232px"
          quality={70}
          class="absolute inset-0 size-full object-cover"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-linear-to-t from-black/65 to-transparent px-4 pt-10 pb-3">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-white">Mini Gole</p>
        </div>
      </BentoCard>

    </div>

    <div class="contents md:flex md:flex-col">
      <BentoCard tone="pink" class="order-2 min-h-32 justify-between md:order-none">
        <p class={title}>Full Stack Developer &amp; Student</p>
        <div class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-between">
          <p class={eyebrow}>Current role</p>
          <Image src={profile} alt="" width={28} height={28} densities={[1, 2]} class="size-7 rounded-full bg-white" />
        </div>
      </BentoCard>

      <NowPlayingCard {...recentFavorite} class="order-5 md:order-none" />

      <!-- White on green by design: it balances the card visually (large display text) -->
      <BentoCard tone="green" class="order-4 flex-1 justify-between text-white md:order-none">
        <p class="font-display text-xl">Welcome to my corner on the internet :)</p>
        <a href="/about" class={cardLink}>My journey <ArrowUpRight class="size-3.5" /></a>
      </BentoCard>

    </div>

    <div class="contents md:flex md:flex-col">
      <BentoCard tone="yellow" class="order-6 col-span-2 md:order-none md:col-span-1">
        <span class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/50">
          <PenTool class="size-4" />
        </span>
        <p class:list={[title, "mt-4"]}>Building scalable &amp; performant web apps</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5" aria-label="Stack">
          {["React", "TypeScript", "Modern backends"].map((item) => (
            <li class="rounded-full bg-black/8 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs">{item}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <a href="/bio" class={cardLink}>Read my logs <ArrowUpRight class="size-3.5" /></a>
      </BentoCard>

      <BentoCard tone="brown" class="order-7 col-span-2 flex-1 md:order-none md:col-span-1">
        <p class={title}>Constantly learning</p>
        <p class:list={[body, "mt-1"]}>Web patterns, agentic workflows &amp; craft.</p>
        <ToolsDock />
      </BentoCard>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
